{"turn_id": "d10-t2", "session_id": "d10", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "task_and_types", "text": "该论文描述 CAp 2017 挑战，任务是面向法语推文的命名实体识别（NER），标注采用 13 种实体类型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-b04d61992fc7b6eeaf190b29"}]}, {"key": "identification_then_typing", "text": "在挑战框架中，需要先识别数据集中出现的实体，然后用 13 种可能类型之一对其进行标注。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}, {"key": "type_descriptions", "text": "论文为每种实体类型提供了描述，这些描述同时提供给标注者和挑战参与者。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}, {"key": "mentions_hashtags_protocol", "text": "标注过程中，推文中的 @ 提及和 # 话题标签按特定协议处理：只有当条件同时满足时，话题标签或提及才应被标注为实体。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}, {"key": "mentions_vs_hashtags_function", "text": "论文指出，@ 提及用于指人，而 # 话题标签用于指示关键词；这是标注处理其功能区别的背景。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}, {"key": "inter_annotator_kappa", "text": "标注者间一致性基于 Cohen's Kappa 测量，计算使用训练集的前 200 条推文；论文报告 Kappa 为 0.70，并称这表示强一致性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}, {"key": "annotator_profile", "text": "标注者是法语母语者，并且此前有 NER 任务经验。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-69a9a888db97860c135c9515"}]}, {"key": "data_source_and_size", "text": "推文通过公开可用的 Twitter API 收集；构建的数据集包含约 6,000 条推文，并划分为训练集和测试集。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-69a9a888db97860c135c9515"}, {"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-b04d61992fc7b6eeaf190b29"}]}, {"key": "annotation_discussed_in_paper", "text": "论文摘要说明，文中详细介绍了标注过程以及作者所做的必要决策，并提供了标注者间一致性统计。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-b04d61992fc7b6eeaf190b29"}]}, {"key": "entity_type_list", "text": "挑战要求的 13 种实体类型为：person、musicartist、organisation、geoloc、product、transportLine、media、sportsteam、event、tvshow、movie、facility、other。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-2da092855580ca68f6de58a1"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d10-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
